        "summary": "Editorial + video kanban. Columns = stage. `type` picks the path: Written runs Idea→Research→Draft→Review→Scheduled→Published; Video adds Footage/Voiceover/Assemble (appended to the option list, so they sit after Published in board order). For type=Video, `pupa/automations.json` fires a skill per stage (Draft→project-kickoff/script, Footage→gather, Voiceover→generate-audio, Assemble→build-video, Review→review-reel, Published→publish-video) and keeps a per-project \"▶ <title>\" checklist in sync via the project-checklist skill. Brainstorm in Studio Room with @Researcher @Editor @Ideator @Scriptwriter @Producer."
      },
