                  "text": "Happy to spin some up! But I riff best with a target — give me two things:\n\n1. **Topic** — what's the piece about?\n2. **Platform + audience** — a LinkedIn post for founders needs a very different angle than a TikTok for Gen Z.\n\nOnce I've got that, I'll hit you with 3–5 distinct angles (contrarian, personal-story, data-first, listicle, myth-bust) each with a scroll-stopping hook. What are we making?",
